    <briefdescription>
<para>Loads and validates rewrite rules from YAML configuration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>YAML rules are restricted to:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_regex_rewrite_rule" kindref="compound">RegexRewriteRule</ref> (type: regex)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_dictionary_rewrite_rule" kindref="compound">DictionaryRewriteRule</ref> (type: dictionary)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safe for loading and rule creation, but not for concurrent modifications. </para>
